# How many nuclear warheads are left in the world?
subtitle: "Draw how the world's nuclear stockpile changed after its 1986 peak of 70,000, then hear about the one country that built bombs and gave them all up."
tags: ["history","data"]
format: quiz
thumb: "band \"Where did they all go?\" note \"70,000 in 1986\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Sadachbia | a lively quiz host who enjoys a surprise; conversational","b":"gemini:Achird | a friendly co-host thinking it through; natural, never exaggerated","take":"lines"}

## How many nuclear warheads are left in the world?
use: line_chart
with:
    x:
      - 1945
      - 1950
      - 1955
      - 1960
      - 1965
      - 1970
      - 1975
      - 1980
      - 1986
      - 1990
      - 1995
      - 2000
      - 2005
      - 2010
      - 2015
      - 2020
      - 2025
    series:
      - {name: Warheads, values: [[0.006, 0.37, 3.3, 22.1, 38.4, 38.8, 47.8, 55.4, 70.4, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null], [0.006, 0.37, 3.3, 22.1, 38.4, 38.8, 47.8, 55.4, 70.4, 61.2, 42.4, 34, 28.4, 21.2, 15.8, 13.1, 12.2]]}
    stage: 0
    xlim:
      - 1945
      - 2025
    ylim:
      - 0
      - 80
    y_label: Thousands
    label_size: 26
    box:
      x: 100
      'y': 110
      w: 860
      h: 480
    label_top: 0
sources:
    - id: owid
      title: Nuclear warhead stockpiles
      authors: Our World in Data, from the Federation of American Scientists
      year: 2026
      url: https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/nuclear-warhead-stockpiles
      finding: world stockpile about 70,400 warheads in 1986, about 12,200 in 2025; China about 290 in 2019 and 600 in 2025; South Africa had 6 in 1989 and 0 since
    - id: fas
      title: Status of World Nuclear Forces
      authors: Federation of American Scientists
      year: 2026
      finding: estimated nuclear warhead stockpiles of the nine nuclear-armed states

    dot pk #b5482e at.data [1986,70.4] hidden true
    text pk_l "70,000" left pk gap 24 #b5482e cites ["owid"] font_size 48 hidden true

    card title "How many nuclear warheads are left?"

A: How many nuclear warheads are left in the world today?
    draw axes

A: The first bombs were built in 1945. By 1986, the world's stockpiles held about seventy thousand.
    draw line_1 pk pk_l

    ask "Draw the rest of the line, to 2025." on line_1 from 1987 store g default 66,58,52,46,41,37,34,32 tolerance 0.08 after keep
        right: Good line. The fall really was that steep.
        wrong: Not quite. Look where the real line ends.

    animate stage 1 duration 1.8

A: About twelve thousand. Five of every six warheads are gone.
    dot now_pt #2f6b8f at.data [2025,12.2]
    text now_l "12,000" above-left now_pt gap 30 #2f6b8f cites ["owid"] font_size 48
    text drop "−83%" #2f6b8f at.data [2012,48] font_size 64

B: So the end of the Cold War did that?
    path cw_m dashed #8f887c points [[1991,0],[1991,76]] data true style.stroke_width 2
    text cw "1991: Cold War ends" #8f887c at.data [2005,74] font_size 34

A: Mostly. Washington and Moscow agreed to take their arsenals apart, year after year.
    highlight cw_m

A: But the cuts have slowed to a crawl: only about a thousand fewer since 2020.
    path slow #f2c14e points [[2020,13.1],[2025,12.2]] data true style.opacity 0.8 style.stroke_width 14
    text slow_l "−1,000 since 2020" #2f6b8f at.data [2009,5] cites ["owid"] font_size 36

    erase drop cw cw_m

A: And China is going the other way. Its stockpile has doubled since 2019, to about six hundred.
    icon cn at.data [2000,58] size 100 set twemoji icon_look picture of "flag china"
    text cn_l "290 → 600" #b5482e at.data [2016,58] cites ["owid"] font_size 48

    erase cn cn_l slow slow_l

B: Here's one for you, though. One country took its count all the way to zero.
    icon sa at.data [2014,64] size 170 set twemoji icon_look picture of "flag south africa"

B: South Africa built six bombs in the 1980s, in secret. Then it took every one apart.
    text sa_l "6 bombs → 0" #2f6b8f at.data [2015,46] cites ["owid"] font_size 56

A: The only country ever to give up nuclear weapons it built itself.
    highlight sa_l effect underline

## Thumbnail
role: thumbnail

    icon bomb size 320 set twemoji x 270 y 430 icon_look picture of bomb hidden true
    text then "1986: 70,000" #b5482e x 700 y 500 font_size 80 hidden true
    text now "Today: ?" #2f6b8f x 700 y 380 font_size 80 hidden true
    thumb b "Where did they all go?" kind band hidden true

